        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Diocese of Buto; Roman Catholic Church; Coptic Orthodox Church; Coptic Orthodox Church of Alexandria\n- Places: Buto; Nile Delta; Egypt; Northeast Africa; Middle East\n- Concepts: titular see; former Christian diocese; Oriental Orthodox Church\n\nFacts:\n- The Diocese of Buto, also called Latin Butus and Greek Butos, was a Christian diocese with its see in the ancient city of Buto in the Nile Delta of Egypt.\n- The Diocese of Buto is a former diocese and is a titular see in both the Roman Catholic Church and the Coptic Orthodox Church.\n- The Coptic Orthodox Church of Alexandria is an Oriental Orthodox Christian church.\n- The Coptic Orthodox Church of Alexandria is based in Egypt, Northeast Africa, and the Middle East.",
